tachyon-blueprint 1
# Talmberg, a small keep and its upper village, for Grimoire's medieval games.
# Made by town/make-talmberg.mjs; edit that and run it again. `label x y Name` names a place.
name talmberg
size 84 86 2
key , floor grass
key T wall leaves
